  "bodyHash": "8cp5eQ1c/ro=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">曾想過要融入當地居民嗎？透過</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村莊偽裝</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，你可以打扮成村民的模樣，在他們之間行走。從農夫沾滿塵土的帽子到圖書管理員精緻的托加袍，每個職業都有其獨特風格。這些服裝或許擋不住箭矢，但它們能贏得人心，並在交易桌上換取更優惠的交易。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每件服裝在與相應職業的村民交易時，都能提供小幅折扣，而穿戴越多件，效果就越顯著。大多數服裝可透過與大師級村民交易獲得。有些套裝較難取得，需從掠奪者或鐵魔像身上掉落，另一些則隱藏在村莊的儲物箱中。無論你是為了收藏、角色扮演，還是單純想吸引你最愛的圖書管理員，這個模組都能讓每次造訪村莊增添更多樂趣。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村民服裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿戴受各村民職業啟發的服裝。每件都能在與相應村民交易時提供折扣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">盔甲匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上護目鏡與圍裙，化身真正的金屬工匠。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🥩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">屠夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">繫上結實的頭帶與圍裙，投入肉品交易。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🗺️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製圖師：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上閃亮的單片眼鏡與皮革背帶，展現俐落風采。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✝️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神職人員：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上高領與精緻長袍，適合神聖的釀造工作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌾 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">農夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上寬邊帽遮陽，並用腰帶隨身攜帶工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">漁夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿戴帽子、背心與護腿，準備好前往碼頭。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製箭師：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">搭配羽毛帽與輕便腰帶，與你的箭矢相映成趣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">👞 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">皮匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上粗獷圍裙，進行鞣革與皮革製作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圖書管理員：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">裹上柔軟的托加袍與整潔頭飾，靜心研讀。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">石匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上沾滿石塵的圍裙，保持整潔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傻子：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿上長袍與護腿，展現慵懶魅力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🐑 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牧羊人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上羊毛帽與背心，保持溫暖。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚒️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">工具匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">套上工作圍裙，準備好進入熔爐旁。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">武器匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戴上眼罩與圍裙，展現專業氣勢。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕰️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">經典村民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在村莊戰利品箱中尋找舊式長袍與護腿。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流浪商人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">交易獲得鮮豔的兜帽、長袍與護腿。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪者服裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">從掠奪者、衛道士、喚魔者與女巫身上掉落。穿戴完整套裝可偽裝成其中一員。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">女巫套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保護你免受有害藥水效果影響。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鐵魔像套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">稀有掉落物，提供擊退抗性與力量加成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎅 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神秘聖誕老人套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為節慶季節準備的歡樂服裝。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝於客戶端與伺服器端</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於FABRIC與NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需安裝</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（適用於FABRIC）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行配置（需安裝</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發，適用於Fabric）。請注意，在舊版Minecraft中，也需安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若需使用外部文字編輯器手動配置，所有檔案皆位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目錄下，依配置類型命名為</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非所有模組都具備全部類型的配置檔案。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/enderpreston/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">EnderPreston</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">創作的原始模組</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-employment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Village Employment</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，其資源在此全新模組中重現，並針對現代Minecraft進行了精煉與更新。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hang-glider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vehicle-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/vehicleupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armored-foes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arcane-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/arcanelanterns/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
